{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1a4fa1abdf22877c76b169674be6a9388222a1eda44b1fe24f621b05579be747", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 玉座へ", "zh": "百合任务 ～天空小猪～ 前往王座", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6899274aefd18b45cb028348579ea5780c42da9d598def1ade5c01d353b3e0b6", "ja": "アイテムで体力を回復し、次なる関門に挑む\n百合子と星梨花。第二の四天王・亜利沙改と\n第三の四天王、真・亜利沙を瞬く間に倒し、\n第四の四天王も名乗る前に撃破。全ての関門\nを抜けた先には、魔王・朋花の姿があった。", "zh": "用道具恢复体力，向下一道关卡发起挑战的\n百合子和星梨花。她们转眼间击败了第二位四天王·改造亜利沙和\n第三位四天王·真亜利沙，甚至在第四位四天王报上名号前就将其击败。穿过全部关卡\n后，魔王·朋花出现在她们面前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "d1549146abbac1377e2f9ebf37ec899ce2e7487786a031ce57a2bcfdbf8f3a4d", "ja": "アイテムで体力も回復しました！　百合子さん！\n四天王を順番に倒していきましょう！", "zh": "用道具恢复体力了！百合子！\n我们按顺序打倒四天王吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "1781e7f87d2b1cac856009460dc1c1e7a796b4716157c2581930ca722adf78d1", "ja": "うん。サポートよろしくね。星梨花ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯。支援就拜托你了，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1002_null", "source_sha256": "a12977c7aa0295aa259a1cb45ae543817d027b736834df33ee4bc95e67e083a8", "ja": "―　地下迷宮・第二関門　―", "zh": "―　地下迷宫·第二道关卡　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "134f6580d1ac40c56ebc7e8ddf28e5f30700aa619c19a606786db727e155ac3c", "ja": "フフフ……。来ましたね、勇者ちゃん！\nわれこそは第二の四天王、ありさ改！", "zh": "呵呵呵……你来了啊，勇者！\n我就是第二位四天王，有纱改！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "c9041d4f80646af21e9125bedd5230398daa27a0aa927abed72624dbd3061bc8", "ja": "すっかりこじらせたありさの勇者ちゃんへの思いは、一\n度や二度倒されたところで消えるものじゃありません！", "zh": "已经钻牛角尖的亜利沙对勇者的这份感情，可不是被打倒一两次就会消失的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "246fcf2442a221626b99097ad8c0f9533919d3a6c07b0add806fdf8679553e85", "ja": "ど、どうしよう星梨花ちゃんっ。\n私、なんだか心の底から、亜利沙さんが恐い……！", "zh": "我、我该怎么办啊，星梨花！  \n我好像……从心底里觉得亚利沙姐很可怕……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "74f559a2ff655e43582cda9ecc64cb4b5330698dc9d9df04c876a54a0f037bb9", "ja": "百合子さん、負けないでください！\n百合子さんなら勝てるって信じてます！", "zh": "百合子小姐，请不要认输！\n我相信，百合子小姐一定能赢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "2180bb1b1fa5e26d26db152d678c0fbddf216f892050bef60eb56f448d01dea5", "ja": "はあ～……、おびえながらも光を失わないその瞳、\nますます最高ですーっ♪　ではっ、いただきますーっ！", "zh": "哈啊～……明明害怕，却依然没有失去光芒的双眸，真是越来越棒了——♪ 那么，我就开动啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "0b7081e9ad990c86edb9f19113c01c864a19bbf2b2e8409c940448b16dd697e6", "ja": "させません！　ファイナリスティックブレイド！", "zh": "不许你得逞！终极之刃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "e6e80c7a55a2e8b899a2761a99cedd36ec8d0bc10ce540363a4a0288d9d9b358", "ja": "ひょえ～～～～～！！\nど、どうして一撃で返されちゃったんですか！？", "zh": "呜哇～～～～～！！\n怎、怎么会被一击反击回来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "127d73ef1d6a182a931dde31a011f76ea1c4fc8a45898c18fc7a273eb90ddf21", "ja": "今のは、いろいろな意味で絶対に亜利沙さんを止めたい\nっていう私の、鋼のように強靭な思いの力です！", "zh": "刚才那是我想从各种意义上都绝对阻止亚利沙小姐，这份钢铁般坚韧的心意所产生的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "1ee86fb4dc74459b00e8bbc28ad7f1836bd5994d2c2c1358b710e801dadb6040", "ja": "うう、ありさの身から出たサビでしたか……。\nたとえありさを倒しても第三の刺客が必ず……がくっ。", "zh": "呜呜，是亚利沙自作自受吗……\n就算打倒了亚利沙，第三名刺客也一定会……呃啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "f80e0e76b02e75d3b0a9756226c6da86a443898e9026edf754ac206d19a907b9", "ja": "第三の刺客って、もしかして……！", "zh": "第三个刺客，难道是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1013_null", "source_sha256": "136a54481f1783aa86bb44fc620691a0cb604fa7a224067144827d0010ff6d57", "ja": "―　地下迷宮・第三関門　―", "zh": "——地下迷宫·第三关——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "0eaf5ef7d5dd93321e55df9829adc4f2bdb92c8e7f10be4cead93201ad6965b3", "ja": "じゃじゃーん、お待たせしましたー！\nわれこそは第三の四天王、真・ありさ！", "zh": "锵锵——让你久等啦！我就是四天王中的第三位，真·亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "3dfb70a2321bd1ce7b0ae08959b92ca9d1b264032ee0cef88b783e0f34f75615", "ja": "ごめんなさい！\nアルティメットスクラッパー！", "zh": "对不起！\n终极废品王！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "259bb165052c5468aaeffbb4607d453e3a384827b9719b3ce67bfba33d7d6449", "ja": "ぎょえ～～～～～！！\nいくらなんでも早すぎませんか～！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊啊～～～～！！\n这也未免太快了吧～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "dfe4866e09dba479bcbc11c9a311144d57ee959e1e07fdf804c0c3d9b3f52583", "ja": "―　地下迷宮・第四関門　―", "zh": "―　地下迷宫・第四关卡　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "c3d79f7e255f7faf796dcad8fd2208886e42e335488408c6a6e0ada996e46dc5", "ja": "そうはいきません！　われこそは第四の……。", "zh": "可没那么容易！我就是第四道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "44fd211a220bb3ba865803b2cfa45d056cfe26b6dbe0d5226428f67b935e76db", "ja": "エンド・オブ・ザ・ワールド！", "zh": "世界末日！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "c262bbd04e9c667436306e6a8570add9721a3409552669f8c534539fb2d750f4", "ja": "うひゃ～～～～～！！", "zh": "呜呀～～～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "98045c266e1cf3e469d257d2ec8cbe8824273b599db21146c6b524d8296f43e7", "ja": "さようなら亜利沙さん。\nあなたは恐ろしい敵でした……！", "zh": "永别了，亜利沙小姐。\n你曾是个可怕的敌人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "41ed64a28b66d5010a05d6fee16cd32ab0b123feac81e4d109454f5511dabfde", "ja": "今のうちです百合子さん、行きましょう！", "zh": "趁现在，百合子小姐，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "12340a0c370849ae24d9f9393850b6aa913b6aedb7452319d67f993ec4661ea5", "ja": "魔王朋花さま～！　……許してください～！\nありさではもう勇者ちゃんには敵わないです……。", "zh": "魔王朋花大人～！……请原谅我～！\n有纱已经不是勇者小姑娘的对手了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "41fbf6525569fdb42f31429333b8700a02c26ec60c5ee2b9c72700f8581f74c3", "ja": "弱音を吐くことは、許していませんよ～♪　勇者は既に\n洞窟を抜けて、魔王城に迫っているそうですね～。", "zh": "我可不允许你说丧气话哦～♪　据说勇者已经穿过洞窟，逼近魔王城了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b67544b5a500e5557df59bef3162e5e7e55cab8853d6232b714959f150a1d39", "ja": "も、もうですか！？　で、でもっ！　魔王城には子豚\nちゃんがたくさんいますから、そうそう簡単には……。", "zh": "已、已经到了吗！？可、可是！魔王城里有好多\n小猪猪，哪有那么容易……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_05_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "28c41239c83e68b8f9e45346add649bc70f648d4652347ce5a412d47d234a180", "ja": "ついに見つけましたよ、魔王！", "zh": "终于找到你了，魔王！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
